  "description": "When I was young, the shaman's grandmother said, \"Your mate is the Dragon King!\"  \n 'Shinhae', who waited for her fate at a single word and missed the wedding date.  Eventually, she is admitted to her marriage village.  Then one day, she meets 'Yunje Kim', a scholar among scholars who jumped out of the river, and he is convinced that he is her dragon king.  But this man is a little strange.  If you don't read a book even for a day, you'll lose your writing...? (MTL)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=784847), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=6746396)",
